  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "a2u5-th1",
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "Le futur simple — будущее время",
      "content": "<p style='margin:0.75rem 0'>Образование: инфинитив + окончания -ai, -as, -a, -ons, -ez, -ont (у глаголов на -re отбрасываем e):</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Лицо</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>parler</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>prendre</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>je</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>parlerai</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>prendrai</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>tu</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>parleras</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>prendras</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>il/elle/on</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>parlera</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>prendra</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>nous</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>parlerons</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>prendrons</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>vous</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>parlerez</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>prendrez</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>ils/elles</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>parleront</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>prendront</td></tr></table><p style='margin:0.75rem 0'>Неправильные основы, которые нужно выучить:</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Глагол</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Основа</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Пример</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>être</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>ser-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>La vie sera différente.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>avoir</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>aur-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>On aura des robots.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>aller</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>ir-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>J'irai sur Mars !</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>faire</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>fer-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>Il fera plus chaud.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>pouvoir</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>pourr-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>On pourra tout faire.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>venir</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>viendr-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>Tu viendras avec nous ?</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>voir</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>verr-</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>Nous verrons bien.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2u5-qz1",
      "type": "grammar-quiz",
      "title": "Futur simple — практика",
      "questions": [
        {
          "question": "Dans 20 ans, les voitures ___ électriques.",
          "options": [
            "seront",
            "serons",
            "sera",
            "êtront"
          ],
          "correctAnswer": "seront",
          "explanation": "Être → ser- + -ont: elles seront."
        },
        {
          "question": "On ___ travailler de la maison.",
          "options": [
            "pourra",
            "pouvra",
            "peut",
            "pourras"
          ],
          "correctAnswer": "pourra",
          "explanation": "Pouvoir → pourr-: on pourra."
        },
        {
          "question": "J'___ une maison intelligente.",
          "options": [
            "aurai",
            "aurais",
            "ai",
            "avoirai"
          ],
          "correctAnswer": "aurai",
          "explanation": "Avoir → aur- + -ai: j'aurai."
        },
        {
          "question": "Nous ___ nos amis en hologramme !",
          "options": [
            "verrons",
            "voirons",
            "voyons",
            "verront"
          ],
          "correctAnswer": "verrons",
          "explanation": "Voir → verr-: nous verrons."
        },
        {
          "question": "Tu ___ à la conférence demain ?",
          "options": [
            "viendras",
            "venira",
            "viens",
            "viendra"
          ],
          "correctAnswer": "viendras",
          "explanation": "Venir → viendr-: tu viendras."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a2u5-th2",
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "Si + présent → futur и местоимение ON",
      "content": "<p style='margin:0.75rem 0'>Реальное условие о будущем: <b>si + настоящее, затем futur simple</b>:</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Условие (présent)</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Результат (futur)</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>Si tu télécharges cette appli,</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>tu gagneras du temps.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>Si on invente ça,</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>tout changera.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>S'il fait beau demain,</td><td style='padding:0.5rem'>nous sortirons.</td></tr></table><p style='margin:0.75rem 0'><b>On</b> — универсальное местоимение (глагол как с il): on = nous (разговорное), люди вообще, кто-то: <i>On verra ! En France, on dîne à 20h.</i></p><p style='margin:0.75rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-left:3px solid #fbbf24;background:rgba(251,191,36,0.08)'>💡 Si + il = <b>s'il</b>, но si + on/elle не сокращается: si on veut, si elle peut.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2u5-qz2",
      "type": "grammar-quiz",
      "title": "Si + futur, ON — практика",
      "questions": [
        {
